    <summary>Lightweight Windows network diagnostics: ping, traceroute, and domain dossier from the system tray</summary>
    <description>
NetPulse is a lightweight network diagnostic tool for Windows. Quick ping, traceroute, and domain dossier lookups from your system tray.

This package downloads the official portable ZIP from GitHub Releases and installs:

* **NetPulse.exe** — desktop GUI (Start Menu shortcut)
* **netpulse** — PATH shim that launches the GUI

## Usage

Launch from the Start Menu shortcut **NetPulse**, or:

```text
netpulse
```

## Project

https://github.com/kilrkrow/netpulse
